  body variants) instead of one long scroll.
- source-connect-config-form.tsx: 2 steps (Apify token, lead sources);
  each row's source-type SelectField (csv/apify/sales_nav) is now a
  ChoiceCardGroup.

All state, load effects, and save() payloads unchanged in every file —
pure layout retrofit.

tsc clean after each file.

