finding risks looking real and setting a false expectation, which is
worse than showing nothing. Verified instead that a REAL preview is
buildable — Leak-Map's pipeline-aging check reads the same
emailPlatform/emailPlatformCredential HubSpot/GHL credential Pin-Down's
own onboarding requires as a blocking field, and Leak-Map is
product-gated behind Pin-Down completing (isProductOnboarded checks
confirmationPageUrl, only written once Pin-Down's blocking fields —
including that exact credential — are filled). So the credential is
guaranteed present by the time anyone reaches this screen, for clients on
HubSpot or GHL specifically (the only platforms this feature covers in a
real run either way).

